    },
    {
      "id": "s7ZZb-0EWbg0UIE-VoOiH",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 471.1111111111111,
      "y": -41.55555555555554,
      "width": 578.9195556640625,
      "height": 400,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "a4",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1975539769,
      "version": 31,
      "versionNonce": 993405497,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1787079275515,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": " # Trace Management\n\n- Generate unique Trace IDs for incoming requests.\n- Generate unique Span IDs for service operations.\n- Maintain parent-child span relationships.\n- Support distributed context propagation across services.\n- Reconstruct complete request execution paths.\n\n# Span Collection\n\n- Capture inbound HTTP requests.\n- Capture outbound HTTP requests.\n- Capture database operations.\n- Capture external API calls.\n- Support custom application spans.\n- Support asynchronous messaging systems.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": " # Trace Management\n\n- Generate unique Trace IDs for incoming requests.\n- Generate unique Span IDs for service operations.\n- Maintain parent-child span relationships.\n- Support distributed context propagation across services.\n- Reconstruct complete request execution paths.\n\n# Span Collection\n\n- Capture inbound HTTP requests.\n- Capture outbound HTTP requests.\n- Capture database operations.\n- Capture external API calls.\n- Support custom application spans.\n- Support asynchronous messaging systems.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "m1VZ8_LGhfzm93nab6UPq",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1170,
      "y": -49,
      "width": 422.71966552734375,
      "height": 425,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "a5",
