      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1787086455032,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Sampling service decides which spans to KEEP or DROP\n\n100K spans/sec  \nsampling rate: 20%(20k) so drop will be 80% (80K)\n\nWorking:\n- Has error?     → Always Keep\n- Very slow?     → Always keep\n- Normal?        → Random 20% keep, 80% drop\n\nto save storage cost we don't store all the spans.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Sampling service decides which spans to KEEP or DROP\n\n100K spans/sec  \nsampling rate: 20%(20k) so drop will be 80% (80K)\n\nWorking:\n- Has error?     → Always Keep\n- Very slow?     → Always keep\n- Normal?        → Random 20% keep, 80% drop\n\nto save storage cost we don't store all the spans.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
